<style> .ev-wc{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:60px 20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif} .ev-wc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px} .ev-wc-card{background:#f9f9f9;border-radius:16px;padding:36px 28px;text-align:center} .ev-wc-icon{width:48px;height:48px;margin:0 auto 20px} .ev-wc-icon svg{width:48px;height:48px} .ev-wc-card h3{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 12px;color:#1a1a1a} .ev-wc-card p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:#555;margin:0} @media(max-width:768px){.ev-wc-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}.ev-wc-card{padding:28px 20px}} </style><div class="ev-wc"><div class="ev-wc-grid"><div class="ev-wc-card"><div class="ev-wc-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="10" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="4" fill="#243918"/><line x1="24" y1="2" x2="24" y2="12" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="24" y1="36" x2="24" y2="46" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="2" y1="24" x2="12" y2="24" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="36" y1="24" x2="46" y2="24" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="8.3" y1="8.3" x2="15.5" y2="15.5" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="32.5" y1="32.5" x2="39.7" y2="39.7" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="8.3" y1="39.7" x2="15.5" y2="32.5" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="32.5" y1="15.5" x2="39.7" y2="8.3" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><h3>Natuurlijke Astaxanthine</h3><p>Gewonnen uit Haematococcus pluvialis microalgen,levert deze 12mg dosis een van de krachtigste antioxidanten van de natuur,ontworpen voor dagelijkse,langdurige cellulaire ondersteuning.</p></div><div class="ev-wc-card"><div class="ev-wc-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><ellipse cx="24" cy="24" rx="14" ry="8" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/><path d="M16 24c0-2 1.5-6 8-6s8 4 8 6" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M18 28l2-4m10 4l-2-4" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="24" cy="22" r="2" fill="#243918"/><path d="M24 10v6m0 16v6" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M12 14l4 4m16-4l-4 4" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><h3>Verbeterde Opname</h3><p>Vetoplosbare verbindingen vereisen de juiste afgifte. Onze oliegebaseerde formule maximaliseert de biobeschikbaarheid zodat actieve ingrediënten uw cellen effectief bereiken.</p></div><div class="ev-wc-card"><div class="ev-wc-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M24 4L6 14v14c0 10 8 14 18 16 10-2 18-6 18-16V14L24 4z" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/><path d="M16 24l5 5 11-11" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><h3>Schoon &amp;Laboratorium Getest</h3><p>Elke batch Eveom™ Astaxanthine wordt geproduceerd in een GMP-gecertificeerde faciliteit. Non-GMO,glutenvrij,sojavrij en gemaakt zonder synthetische ingrediënten,harde toevoegingen of vulstoffen.</p></div></div></div>

